<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Recipe>
  <Description type="ReactiveSputtering">
    <Title>Textbook Ex06: Reactive N2/Ar Sputtering Sweep (0-2-4-0 sccm)</Title>
    <Author>APS Control Community</Author>
    <Created>2026-11-25</Created>
    <Modified>2026-11-25</Modified>
    <Notes>Fixed 20 sccm Ar1, 2 mTorr TC1 pressure, and 250 mA DC on Si (PSU_A). Exposes 60 s after 90 s conditioning at N21 = 0, 2, 4, and 0 sccm (V1), then shuts down PSU_A, opens TC1, and clears Ar1.</Notes>
  </Description>
  <Parameters />
  <Script>
valve M1 open
valve V2 open
valve V6 open
mfc Ar1 20
pwait 2mT 300
set PSU_A Current 250
power PSU_A on
wait 90
holder Si
deposit Si 60 Home
valve V1 open
mfc N21 2
pwait 2mT 300
wait 90
deposit Si 60 Home
mfc N21 4
pwait 2mT 300
wait 90
deposit Si 60 Home
mfc N21 0
valve V1 close
pwait 2mT 300
wait 90
deposit Si 60 Home
holder Home
power PSU_A off
set PSU_A Current 0
pwait 0 1
mfc Ar1 0
valve V2 close
valve V6 close
valve M1 close
  </Script>
</Recipe>
